WEBVTT

00:00:03.800 --> 00:00:05.600
That's absolutely impossible!

00:00:05.600 --> 00:00:06.800
You never know!

00:00:06.800 --> 00:00:07.940
Next time, I'll definitely show you-

00:00:07.940 --> 00:00:09.110
Yuma Tsukumo-<i>kun</i>!

00:00:10.140 --> 00:00:11.450
Huh? Who're you?

00:00:11.450 --> 00:00:13.280
Allow me to introduce myself.

00:00:13.280 --> 00:00:19.200
I am the president of the lovely and adventurous Manga Research Club, Chitaro Ariga!

00:00:19.200 --> 00:00:20.420
Manga Club?

00:00:20.420 --> 00:00:22.580
You know, the club with only one member.

00:00:22.580 --> 00:00:24.790
Actually, I have a favor to ask you.

00:00:24.790 --> 00:00:29.170
My Manga Research Club is currently dedicating to a great masterpiece.

00:00:29.170 --> 00:00:33.250
And I wish for you, Yuma-<i>kun</i>, to become the model for the main character!

00:00:33.260 --> 00:00:35.550
You want me as a model for your manga?

00:00:35.550 --> 00:00:37.340
That's awesome, Yuma-<i>kun</i>!

00:00:37.340 --> 00:00:37.970
Yeah!

00:00:37.970 --> 00:00:42.540
The supreme king of the Duel Carnival, the man of all men, Yuma Tsukumo-<i>kun</i>.

00:00:42.680 --> 00:00:45.080
No one is a better model for this than you!

00:00:45.080 --> 00:00:47.080
Wow, that's me?

00:00:47.080 --> 00:00:47.970
Yes.

00:00:47.970 --> 00:00:51.150
By the way, Yuma-<i>kun</i>, do you have a weakness?

00:00:51.150 --> 00:00:53.620
My weakness...?

00:00:53.620 --> 00:00:56.000
There's no such thing! No, sir!

00:00:57.610 --> 00:00:59.450
That's good to hear, I guess.

00:00:59.450 --> 00:01:00.510
Hmm?

00:01:00.510 --> 00:01:01.420
Hold on a minute.

00:01:02.740 --> 00:01:04.790
Ryouga-<i>kun</i>! Ryouga Kamishiro-<i>kun</i>!

00:01:05.680 --> 00:01:08.540
I'd like for you to be my model as well!

00:01:08.540 --> 00:01:11.000
Look, this is the character based on you!

00:01:11.000 --> 00:01:13.960
I think you'll be satisfied with this design.

00:01:15.420 --> 00:01:16.800
You've got no taste.

00:01:18.050 --> 00:01:19.480
Please wait!

00:01:19.480 --> 00:01:20.850
Hey, let go of me!

00:01:20.850 --> 00:01:22.170
I'm begging you!

00:01:22.170 --> 00:01:22.970
Get off me!

00:01:27.440 --> 00:01:28.440
Huh?

00:01:31.620 --> 00:01:32.360
Don't touch it!

00:01:38.600 --> 00:01:39.680
Are you all right?

00:01:40.540 --> 00:01:41.740
Ah, thank you!

00:01:43.020 --> 00:01:49.330
I wrote the ideas for my manga that I treasure more than my life in this sketchbook.

00:01:51.590 --> 00:01:54.770
Then I'm looking forward to your manga!

00:01:54.770 --> 00:01:56.850
Hey, Shark, wait a sec!

00:02:00.510 --> 00:02:03.110
You've got a sharp tongue as usual.

00:02:03.110 --> 00:02:05.220
What's wrong with stating the truth?

00:02:12.880 --> 00:02:14.530
Rio...

00:02:14.530 --> 00:02:17.690
Just when will you wake up...?

00:02:20.110 --> 00:02:20.850
Rio...

00:02:23.740 --> 00:02:25.410
<i>Here, Ryouga!</i>

00:02:26.200 --> 00:02:29.000
<i>You really think we can wear matching rings?</i>

00:02:29.000 --> 00:02:30.870
<i>Besides, why would a man wear a ring?</i>

00:02:30.870 --> 00:02:34.090
<i>What's with that tone? Then just forget it!</i>

00:02:36.250 --> 00:02:37.850
<i>Ryouga, you're such a jerk!</i>

00:02:59.310 --> 00:03:02.570
What?! We're attacking Ryouga Kamishiro?

00:03:02.570 --> 00:03:07.040
Yes. Although I failed to find Yuma Tsukumo's weak points,

00:03:07.040 --> 00:03:10.480
I did manage to find Ryouga's weak point.

00:03:10.480 --> 00:03:11.500
Oh?

00:03:11.500 --> 00:03:17.130
Every step of my plan
is illustrated inside this sketchbook.

00:03:18.050 --> 00:03:20.090
Very well. Go and do it.

00:03:20.090 --> 00:03:23.970
Roger! Everything is for the Barian World!

00:03:23.970 --> 00:03:28.310
Oh, by the way, I tried to draw some manga as well!

00:03:28.310 --> 00:03:29.280
Pretty good, right?

00:03:29.280 --> 00:03:30.850
Sure...

00:03:33.170 --> 00:03:35.380
<i>It's just beginning now</i>

00:03:35.380 --> 00:03:41.350
<i>This story continues to be etched into my heart endlessly</i>

00:03:41.350 --> 00:03:44.060
<i>These feelings... burning up inside!</i>

00:03:53.860 --> 00:03:56.410
<i>Preparations for the fight are ready</i>

00:03:56.410 --> 00:03:59.490
<i>I can already hear the shivering of my heart</i>

00:03:59.660 --> 00:04:04.000
<i>Been waiting this whole time</i>

00:04:04.000 --> 00:04:06.370
<i>I may meet with defeat...</i>

00:04:06.580 --> 00:04:09.590
<i>But that's exactly why I have to stand back up</i>

00:04:09.790 --> 00:04:14.130
<i>Need to get stronger again</i>

00:04:14.300 --> 00:04:16.260
<i>It's good to believe</i>

00:04:16.430 --> 00:04:18.970
<i>The "now", more than ever before, is</i>

00:04:19.470 --> 00:04:21.430
<i>but another limit to break down</i>

00:04:21.430 --> 00:04:24.480
<i>I can cross with ease</i>

00:04:24.770 --> 00:04:26.940
<i>It's just beginning now</i>

00:04:26.940 --> 00:04:32.980
<i>This story continues to be etched into my heart endlessly</i>

00:04:32.980 --> 00:04:35.740
<i>These feelings... burning up inside!</i>

00:04:35.780 --> 00:04:37.200
<i>Right here in my hand,</i>

00:04:37.200 --> 00:04:41.910
<i>I'm holding a powerful trump card.</i>

00:04:42.030 --> 00:04:50.960
<i>With an unbreakable heart, I face toward my dream!</i>

00:05:02.240 --> 00:05:05.070
This should be enough
for a hospital visit, right?

00:05:05.070 --> 00:05:09.030
Didn't I say that Shark's sister is still unconscious?

00:05:09.030 --> 00:05:10.620
Oh, then those...

00:05:09.950 --> 00:05:14.580
"Shark's Rage!! Save The Captured Little Sister!"

00:05:10.620 --> 00:05:12.700
She can't eat snacks and fruit.

00:05:12.700 --> 00:05:15.750
It's okay! I'll eat 'em all in her place!

00:05:15.750 --> 00:05:17.120
Geez...

00:05:20.710 --> 00:05:23.380
Shark! We're here to visit your sister...

00:05:23.380 --> 00:05:26.840
Rio... Rio has disappeared from her ward!

00:05:26.840 --> 00:05:28.800
Disappeared?

00:05:28.800 --> 00:05:30.600
Where is she now, then?

00:05:30.600 --> 00:05:32.810
What a coincidence. The gang's all here!

00:05:34.270 --> 00:05:35.980
You're from that Manga Club?!

00:05:35.980 --> 00:05:38.980
Could you perhaps... be looking for your little sister?

00:05:38.980 --> 00:05:41.940
Why do you know about Rio?

00:05:41.940 --> 00:05:44.530
Don't tell me you...

00:05:46.320 --> 00:05:50.200
I will tell you where she is, but I have one condition.

00:05:50.200 --> 00:05:51.910
Please Duel with me.

00:05:51.910 --> 00:05:53.830
Duel, you said?

00:05:53.830 --> 00:05:55.620
Stop screwing around, you jerk!

00:05:56.870 --> 00:05:57.830
Yuma.

00:05:57.830 --> 00:06:01.960
Be careful, I can feel an abnormal aura from him.

00:06:01.960 --> 00:06:05.920
So, what do you think, Ryouga-<i>kun</i>?

00:06:06.470 --> 00:06:09.840
Interesting. I accept your challenge to a Duel!

00:06:09.840 --> 00:06:12.100
Duel Disk, set!

00:06:14.310 --> 00:06:16.180
D-Gazer, set!

00:06:18.640 --> 00:06:21.610
<i>AR Vision: Link established.</i>

00:06:24.570 --> 00:06:25.530
Duel!!

00:06:25.530 --> 00:06:28.910
I'll never forgive you.

00:06:28.910 --> 00:06:30.490
My turn! Draw!

00:06:30.490 --> 00:06:32.950
I Summon Sharktopus!

00:06:36.330 --> 00:06:41.630
Then, by releasing a Water-Attribute Monster on my field,

00:06:41.630 --> 00:06:43.750
I Summon Sharkraken!

00:06:45.500 --> 00:06:49.220
Then I set one card, and end my turn!

00:06:50.720 --> 00:06:52.930
My turn! Draw!

00:06:52.930 --> 00:06:56.390
I activate the Field Magic, Comic Field!

00:06:57.060 --> 00:06:59.520
This field is the world of my manga!

00:06:59.980 --> 00:07:03.110
Everything will be decided with my set stories!

00:07:06.320 --> 00:07:11.530
Which means only the hero <i>I</i> created is the real hero of love, frankness, and courage!

00:07:11.530 --> 00:07:14.080
Hero Shark,

00:07:14.080 --> 00:07:18.620
this match will lead to your defeat as we enter the ending!

00:07:18.620 --> 00:07:22.420
I Summon Lancelot, Knight of the Lake!

00:07:26.170 --> 00:07:30.090
Then I activate a Magic Card, Sword Oath!

00:07:30.090 --> 00:07:34.350
When there is a Warrior-Type Monster on my field,

00:07:34.350 --> 00:07:38.520
I can Special Summon one Level Four 
Warrior-Type Monster from my hand!

00:07:39.390 --> 00:07:42.480
I Summon Tristan, Knight of Tragic Love!

00:07:47.980 --> 00:07:50.110
There are two Level Four Monsters!

00:07:50.110 --> 00:07:50.780
Is he gonna do it!

00:07:51.150 --> 00:07:54.490
I Overlay the Level Four Lancelot and Tristan!

00:07:57.580 --> 00:08:00.500
I build the Overlay Network using these two Monsters!

00:08:00.500 --> 00:08:01.710
Xyz Summon!

00:08:02.620 --> 00:08:06.210
Come forth, Comic Hero King Arthur!

00:08:09.380 --> 00:08:11.170
Lancelot's effect activates!

00:08:12.590 --> 00:08:15.970
When this card becomes an Overlay Unit,

00:08:15.970 --> 00:08:20.100
it can reduce the Attack Power of one of the opposing Monsters by 800 points!

00:08:20.730 --> 00:08:22.600
Go, King Arthur!

00:08:22.600 --> 00:08:24.350
Attack Sharkraken!

00:08:26.150 --> 00:08:27.110
How naive!

00:08:27.900 --> 00:08:30.320
My set card is Zeus Breath!

00:08:30.480 --> 00:08:32.990
It negates the attack of one opposing Monster,

00:08:32.990 --> 00:08:35.110
and then this Trap deals 800 damage to you!

00:08:36.570 --> 00:08:39.040
Here goes! Zeus Breath, acti-

00:08:39.080 --> 00:08:41.660
You sure attacking me is a good idea?

00:08:41.660 --> 00:08:43.120
What?

00:08:43.120 --> 00:08:45.830
Ryouga, I'll tell you...

00:08:45.830 --> 00:08:49.420
...what's going on with your sister right now!

00:08:52.670 --> 00:08:56.640
Right now, your sister is inside the fantasy world I created.

00:08:56.640 --> 00:08:59.430
In other words, she's inside the world of manga!

00:08:59.430 --> 00:09:00.430
R-Rio?!

00:09:01.600 --> 00:09:03.140
I-Impossible...!

00:09:03.140 --> 00:09:04.890
If you defeat me,

00:09:04.890 --> 00:09:08.060
the fantasy world I created will be destroyed along with me!

00:09:08.060 --> 00:09:10.980
And what happens to your sister <i>then</i>...?

00:09:14.570 --> 00:09:15.860
You bastard...!

00:09:15.860 --> 00:09:17.870
Is that even possible?

00:09:17.870 --> 00:09:18.820
That's cowardly!

00:09:20.450 --> 00:09:23.290
Ryouga Kamishiro, you can't win this!

00:09:23.870 --> 00:09:26.790
Now, let me recover your Number!

00:09:26.790 --> 00:09:29.290
King Arthur, resume your attack!

00:09:29.290 --> 00:09:30.590
Flash Sword!

00:09:41.680 --> 00:09:45.230
I set one card! Turn end!

00:09:45.230 --> 00:09:47.940
Dammit...! At this rate, Shark will...

00:09:47.940 --> 00:09:51.020
As I thought, this person is one of Barian's assassins.

00:09:55.490 --> 00:09:58.820
It's all over for you, Ryouga Kamishiro!

00:09:58.820 --> 00:10:02.160
We need to think of a way to save Rio-<i>san</i>!

00:10:02.160 --> 00:10:06.460
But this field is a world <i>he</i> created...

00:10:06.460 --> 00:10:08.670
You can say these are all his creations.

00:10:09.210 --> 00:10:10.330
Creations?

00:10:13.050 --> 00:10:15.840
Yuma, that guy's sketchbook!

00:10:15.840 --> 00:10:17.090
Huh?

00:10:17.090 --> 00:10:22.100
The world he created should 
all be drawn inside it. And if it is...

00:10:22.100 --> 00:10:25.270
I see! That sketchbook should have some hints inside!

00:10:28.310 --> 00:10:29.730
Wait for me, Shark.

00:10:29.730 --> 00:10:32.230
I swear I'll help your sister!

00:10:32.230 --> 00:10:35.230
I'm gonna save her!

00:10:35.230 --> 00:10:38.700
My turn! Draw!

00:10:38.700 --> 00:10:40.910
I Summon Hammer Shark!

00:10:44.700 --> 00:10:47.040
No, I don't care about <i>that</i> Monster!

00:10:47.040 --> 00:10:48.790
Call out your Number!

00:10:51.670 --> 00:10:53.790
No helping it. I'll give you a hand!

00:10:53.790 --> 00:10:56.510
Trap, activate! Hero's Agony!

00:10:57.340 --> 00:11:00.090
When there is a Comic Hero on my field...

00:11:00.090 --> 00:11:02.510
...when my opponent Summons a Monster...

00:11:02.510 --> 00:11:05.890
...my opponent selects two Monsters with the same level as the Summoned Monster...

00:11:05.890 --> 00:11:08.270
...and Special Summons it from the deck!

00:11:08.270 --> 00:11:10.900
Now Summon them, Ryouga!

00:11:11.900 --> 00:11:16.230
I Special Summon Spear Shark and Two-Head Shark!

00:11:19.860 --> 00:11:22.450
Now call out your Number!

00:11:23.950 --> 00:11:29.290
I Overlay Hammer Shark, Spear Shark, and Two-Head Shark!

00:11:29.290 --> 00:11:32.370
I build the Overlay Network using these Three Monsters!

00:11:33.080 --> 00:11:34.500
Xyz Summon!

00:11:36.920 --> 00:11:39.760
Come forth, Number 32!

00:11:39.760 --> 00:11:42.130
Marine Biting Dragon - Shark Drake!

00:11:45.850 --> 00:11:47.720
Now, what's next?

00:11:47.720 --> 00:11:49.890
I can't declare an attack anyway, right?

00:11:50.180 --> 00:11:51.690
Far from it!

00:11:51.690 --> 00:11:53.310
Attack to your heart's content!

00:11:53.310 --> 00:11:54.150
What did you say?

00:11:54.150 --> 00:11:58.610
All of your attacks have been written in my story!

00:11:58.610 --> 00:12:03.490
Forced into a corner by the strongest enemy, 
the true hero stands up!

00:12:03.490 --> 00:12:05.700
<i>Just what is he planning?!</i>

00:12:05.700 --> 00:12:08.450
<i>But right now, I can only do what he wants me to...</i>

00:12:08.450 --> 00:12:11.410
Damn it! Go, Shark Drake!

00:12:11.410 --> 00:12:13.290
Attack King Arthur!

00:12:13.750 --> 00:12:14.880
Depth Bite!

00:12:27.140 --> 00:12:30.220
No way! I can't believe King Arthur was defeated!

00:12:31.600 --> 00:12:35.980
King Arthur! The world peace and everyone's hope are all entrusted to you!

00:12:36.270 --> 00:12:37.730
Stand up, King Arthur!

00:12:39.230 --> 00:12:42.700
I activate the effect of the Field Magic, Comic Field!

00:12:42.700 --> 00:12:46.200
When a Comic Hero on my field was destroyed by battle,

00:12:46.200 --> 00:12:50.660
it negates that destruction
 and increases its Attack Power by 500!

00:12:51.410 --> 00:12:53.910
Revive, King Arthur!

00:12:56.500 --> 00:12:59.750
Then, when King Arthur's Attack Power changes,

00:12:59.750 --> 00:13:02.420
King Arthur's effect activates!

00:13:02.420 --> 00:13:07.850
By detaching one Overlay Unit, the amount of Attack Points increased is inflicted as damage to the opponent!

00:13:07.850 --> 00:13:09.560
Storm Sword!

00:13:14.180 --> 00:13:15.060
Shark!

00:13:15.060 --> 00:13:18.110
How's that? Did you learn a lesson, underling of evil?!

00:13:20.730 --> 00:13:23.570
I set one card and end my turn.

00:13:23.570 --> 00:13:27.740
Alright, here I come! My turn! Draw!

00:13:28.490 --> 00:13:32.200
I equip the Equip Magic,
 Miraculous Giant Sword, to King Arthur!

00:13:32.200 --> 00:13:36.080
Thus, his Attack Power goes up 500 points!

00:13:37.330 --> 00:13:39.290
His Attack Power changed!

00:13:39.290 --> 00:13:42.000
I detach one Overlay Unit,

00:13:42.000 --> 00:13:46.340
and inflict damage to you
 equal to the change of Attack Points!

00:13:46.340 --> 00:13:47.970
Storm Sword!

00:13:52.930 --> 00:13:57.310
I'm not done yet! King Arthur, attack Shark Drake!

00:13:57.310 --> 00:13:58.690
Flash Sword!

00:14:05.820 --> 00:14:10.450
What a shame. Numbers can only
 be defeated by other Numbers.

00:14:11.120 --> 00:14:15.160
But you know, even this
was already written in the story.

00:14:15.160 --> 00:14:18.250
I activate the effect of Miraculous Giant Sword!

00:14:18.250 --> 00:14:23.670
When the equipped Monster failed to destroy the opposing Monster in a battle,

00:14:23.670 --> 00:14:28.720
I can send Miraculous Giant Sword to the Graveyard and activate this Magic Card from my hand!

00:14:28.720 --> 00:14:32.300
Defeat the evil for the sake of Barian World!

00:14:32.300 --> 00:14:36.390
I activate the Rank-Up Magic, Barian's Force!

00:14:36.390 --> 00:14:37.100
That's...?!

00:14:37.100 --> 00:14:38.690
That guy really is Barian's...!

00:14:39.140 --> 00:14:44.480
I use Comic Hero King Arthur to
 rebuild the Overlay Network!

00:14:46.150 --> 00:14:49.110
Chaos Xyz Change!

00:14:49.110 --> 00:14:55.040
Now is the time to show yourself!
 Become the symbol of the great power of Barian!

00:14:55.040 --> 00:14:59.920
Chaos Xyz! Comic Hero Legend Arthur!

00:15:03.380 --> 00:15:06.090
So this is the new power of Barian!

00:15:06.090 --> 00:15:10.550
When a Chaos Xyz is Special Summoned via Rank-Up Magic,

00:15:10.550 --> 00:15:16.770
it gains all the Overlay Units from one Xyz Monster on my opponent's field!

00:15:17.180 --> 00:15:18.560
Chaos Drain!

00:15:20.390 --> 00:15:23.860
Then, for each Overlay Unit that was snatched,

00:15:23.860 --> 00:15:27.360
your Monster loses 300 Attack Points!

00:15:27.940 --> 00:15:30.280
The battle isn't over yet!

00:15:30.280 --> 00:15:35.280
Monsters Summoned by Barian's Force
 can even destroy Numbers!

00:15:35.280 --> 00:15:40.040
Go, Legend Arthur! Attack Shark Drake!

00:15:40.040 --> 00:15:41.830
Chaos Blast!

00:15:48.420 --> 00:15:49.920
<i>Shark! Hey, Shark!</i>

00:15:50.380 --> 00:15:52.680
<i>Yu... Yuma?</i>

00:15:52.680 --> 00:15:54.390
Shark, I found it!

00:15:54.390 --> 00:15:58.350
As expected, I found the sketchbook in that guy's room!

00:15:58.350 --> 00:16:00.350
The sketches of the manga are inside, too!

00:16:03.190 --> 00:16:09.230
<i>Your little sister is the heroine that has been captured and thrown into prison!</i>

00:16:10.110 --> 00:16:11.570
Rio...

00:16:12.400 --> 00:16:13.950
Looks like he found it.

00:16:13.950 --> 00:16:18.080
But it's useless! The ending won't change!

00:16:18.080 --> 00:16:19.330
The ending?

00:16:20.410 --> 00:16:22.750
The s<i>ad end</i>, that is...

00:16:22.750 --> 00:16:24.880
I'll tell you guys, too.

00:16:24.880 --> 00:16:27.880
In order to release the captured princess,

00:16:27.880 --> 00:16:32.220
Shark, the Devil's Messenger, is fighting me, the hero...

00:16:32.220 --> 00:16:34.550
and the Evil is finally destroyed!

00:16:34.550 --> 00:16:37.050
But it was already too late.

00:16:37.050 --> 00:16:41.810
The princess has fallen into an eternal sleep.

00:16:41.810 --> 00:16:46.270
In other words, you will lose the Duel
 and your sister won't be saved!

00:16:46.270 --> 00:16:48.020
How can that be?!

00:16:52.320 --> 00:16:57.120
So that means... it's useless, no matter what we do...?

00:16:58.160 --> 00:16:59.240
That ain't gonna happen!

00:17:00.990 --> 00:17:04.830
How can our future be decided by something like <i>that</i>?!

00:17:04.830 --> 00:17:08.130
<i>Stand up, Shark! Stand up and fight!</i>

00:17:08.130 --> 00:17:11.050
<i>You're the only one who
 can protect your little sister right now!</i>

00:17:11.630 --> 00:17:14.260
<i>Just crush everything that stands in your way!</i>

00:17:14.260 --> 00:17:15.510
<i>That's what a </i>Shark<i> does, right?!</i>

00:17:18.430 --> 00:17:19.430
Yuma...

00:17:20.810 --> 00:17:23.480
<i>Ryouga... Ryouga!</i>

00:17:24.730 --> 00:17:27.440
<i>Ryouga... You have to win this Duel!</i>

00:17:28.150 --> 00:17:29.570
That's right, Rio.

00:17:31.230 --> 00:17:33.780
I have no idea what kind of future is awaiting me.

00:17:33.780 --> 00:17:35.610
But I will always protect you, Rio!

00:17:35.610 --> 00:17:38.620
So please, Rio, wake up!

00:17:39.950 --> 00:17:43.620
Rio!

00:17:45.660 --> 00:17:46.420
Rio...

00:17:54.760 --> 00:17:55.720
Ryouga...

00:17:56.550 --> 00:17:57.430
Ryouga!

00:18:17.240 --> 00:18:18.410
Rio...

00:18:18.410 --> 00:18:20.910
Impossible! Why?!

00:18:20.910 --> 00:18:22.370
Rio-<i>san</i>!

00:18:22.370 --> 00:18:24.620
Yuma-<i>kun</i>, she's...!

00:18:24.620 --> 00:18:25.370
Yeah!

00:18:25.370 --> 00:18:30.670
So his feelings towards his little sister have broken the curse of Barian.

00:18:30.670 --> 00:18:33.170
Ryouga!

00:18:33.170 --> 00:18:35.840
Could it be that you're losing this Duel?

00:18:35.840 --> 00:18:38.970
I can't believe you'd actually dare to lose in front of <i>me</i>...

00:18:40.010 --> 00:18:41.680
And <i>whose</i> fault do you think that is?!

00:18:41.680 --> 00:18:42.890
I won't accept this!

00:18:43.930 --> 00:18:46.680
I won't accept you breaking my fantasy world!

00:18:47.520 --> 00:18:49.940
I activate Legend Arthur's effect!

00:18:49.940 --> 00:18:54.190
When it destroys my opponent's Monster, by detaching one Overlay Unit,

00:18:54.190 --> 00:18:58.240
it Banishes one Monster from the Graveyard that was destroyed by battle,

00:18:58.240 --> 00:19:02.030
and inflicts damage equal to its Attack Power to my opponent!

00:19:04.830 --> 00:19:05.990
What?!

00:19:08.080 --> 00:19:09.750
What a pity!

00:19:09.750 --> 00:19:13.290
I activated the Trap Card, Torrential Reborn!

00:19:13.290 --> 00:19:19.260
This card can be activated when a Water-Attribute Monster on my field was destroyed.

00:19:19.260 --> 00:19:22.930
At that moment, I can Special Summon
 all of the destroyed Monsters,

00:19:23.430 --> 00:19:27.890
and it inflicts 500 damage to the opposing player
 for each resurrected Monster!

00:19:28.730 --> 00:19:30.100
Impossible...

00:19:32.150 --> 00:19:34.650
My turn! Draw!

00:19:34.650 --> 00:19:39.150
I use Shark Drake as Xyz Material!

00:19:39.150 --> 00:19:40.900
Chaos Xyz Change!

00:19:41.780 --> 00:19:45.240
Come forth, Chaos Number 32!

00:19:45.240 --> 00:19:48.290
Marine Biting Dragon - Shark Drake Veiss!

00:19:48.290 --> 00:19:51.000
Shark Drake Veiss' effect activates!

00:19:51.000 --> 00:19:56.460
By detaching one Overlay Unit, it Banishes one "Shark" Monster from my Graveyard!

00:19:57.250 --> 00:20:00.720
I Banish Shark Drake!

00:20:00.720 --> 00:20:06.100
Shark Drake's 2800 Attack Power
 is taken away from Legend Arthur!

00:20:10.100 --> 00:20:13.980
Then I activate the Quick-Play Magic, Surging-Wave Erosion!

00:20:13.980 --> 00:20:17.400
This card destroys one Field Magic!

00:20:17.400 --> 00:20:21.110
Now that ridiculous field of yours has completely vanished!

00:20:24.820 --> 00:20:27.280
My Comic Field is...!

00:20:27.280 --> 00:20:32.000
Then, with this card, the Attack Power of Water-Attribute Monsters on the field is...

00:20:32.000 --> 00:20:34.290
...increased by 500 points!

00:20:36.330 --> 00:20:39.210
Go, Shark Drake Veiss!

00:20:39.210 --> 00:20:41.050
Attack Legend Arthur!

00:20:41.670 --> 00:20:45.090
Depth Chaos Bite!!

00:20:57.110 --> 00:20:58.320
<i>Good job, Shark!</i>

00:20:58.320 --> 00:21:01.530
<i>You're still so strong! How cool is this!</i>

00:21:01.530 --> 00:21:03.280
<i>Mr. President!</i>

00:21:03.280 --> 00:21:05.490
<i>That's what I call the sound of a beating!</i>

00:21:05.490 --> 00:21:06.240
Where am I...?

00:21:06.240 --> 00:21:10.240
<i>Three cheers for Ryouga Kamishiro-</i>kun<i>! Banzai!</i>

00:21:12.370 --> 00:21:14.210
And he was so close, too...!

00:21:14.210 --> 00:21:16.460
What a useless delusional bastard!

00:21:20.550 --> 00:21:21.550
Ryouga...

00:21:34.230 --> 00:21:35.770
Ryouga Kamishiro-<i>kun</i>!

00:21:36.480 --> 00:21:37.060
Huh?

00:21:37.520 --> 00:21:38.440
Please have a look!

00:21:40.270 --> 00:21:43.190
I had an idea to model the main character after you!

00:21:43.190 --> 00:21:45.900
Whoa! That's cool!

00:21:46.240 --> 00:21:47.240
Nonsense...

00:21:49.240 --> 00:21:51.200
So, what about mine?

00:21:51.200 --> 00:21:53.700
Oh, it's this one...

00:22:00.380 --> 00:22:03.050
That really does fit Yuma.

00:22:03.050 --> 00:22:04.010
So true.

00:22:06.380 --> 00:22:10.260
So I <i>ain't </i>the main character?!

00:22:17.770 --> 00:22:24.650
<i>Does the thought "In any case..." following</i>

00:22:25.070 --> 00:22:32.330
<i>the foreboding premonition tell you to give up?</i>

00:22:32.330 --> 00:22:39.920
<i>Do you laugh at your dreams, saying "impossible"?</i>

00:22:39.920 --> 00:22:47.260
<i>You must find it funny that I'm not able to laugh at it, right?</i>

00:22:47.800 --> 00:23:04.190
<i>This song supports me, so I'll do my best for you this time.
 It's my turn to sing now.</i>

00:23:04.190 --> 00:23:08.990
<i>I will vow to you here</i>

00:23:08.990 --> 00:23:19.330
<i>As long as I live, you'll always be my tiny, little friend</i>

00:23:19.330 --> 00:23:27.880
<i>I'll erase all those little mistakes of yours</i>

00:23:27.880 --> 00:23:32.680
<i>Because I want to become an artist</i>

00:23:34.470 --> 00:23:38.980
<i>Look, I like doing it 'cuz it's fun.</i>

00:23:40.980 --> 00:23:44.610
Shark's sister is back in school after she was released from the hospital!

00:23:44.610 --> 00:23:47.780
But those Barian guys are trying to take away Shark's Number once again!

00:23:47.780 --> 00:23:49.990
They're after his sister once again!

00:23:49.990 --> 00:23:52.070
Rio-<i>san</i> is capable of doing almost everything!

00:23:52.070 --> 00:23:53.280
I'm so envious of her!

00:23:53.280 --> 00:23:56.120
Hey, everyone! What the heck is going on here?

00:23:56.120 --> 00:23:58.120
Yuma, this is Barian's trap!

00:23:58.120 --> 00:24:00.960
You can't do it alone! This is not an ordinary Duel!

00:24:01.290 --> 00:24:03.040
Next time on Yu-Gi-Oh! ZeXal II!

00:24:03.330 --> 00:24:06.090
"Wild Dance of Ice!! The Icy Queen, Rio Kamishiro"

00:24:06.710 --> 00:24:09.300
Awesome! So this is Shark's little sister!
